    "body": "Doh, only `dispatchEvent()` is guarded. But stop propagation and such seems like it would matter? Or maybe even that does not matter as nothing else can get a hold of this event object as the object that does the forwarding is not reachable to script. Hmm.\r\n\r\n@smaug---- thoughts?",
